        <briefdescription>
<para>If an <ref refid="d9/dbf/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1javajit_1_1_injector" kindref="compound">Injector</ref> can validate what Resources it can provide based on a known set of requests, it can provide that information via this method. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>resources</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>a collection of Resources that may be requested</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>a Map keyed by Resource with a corresponding indicator of whether the Resource is available as a fixed singleton value (which can be obtained via <computeroutput><ref refid="d9/dbf/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1javajit_1_1_injector_1a7cf54e00445bb9f28f64823bc1cd4426" kindref="member">valueOf</ref></computeroutput>); anything not in this Map is not known for certain to be available, but may still be available upon request </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
